From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 22:30:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mac80211: report the totals of an MLO station when it
 is removed

The removal notification of a station carries its closing counters, and
userspace that keeps totals across a station's departure takes them
from there. For an MLO station they were the counters of the default
link alone: mac80211 filled the station info without links, so
sta_set_sinfo() dropped every link, and cfg80211_del_sta_sinfo() sent
it without the MLD aggregation that NL80211_CMD_GET_STATION applies.
The received counters of the other links and the counters of removed
links were missing.

Fill the station info of a removed station as ieee80211_get_station()
does: allocate its links, then add the counters of removed links. Apply
cfg80211_sta_set_mld_sinfo() before the notification is sent. As in
NL80211_CMD_GET_STATION, a link whose interface link is already gone,
which is the case when the interface removes the link and flushes its
stations, or whose link info could not be allocated, is not counted.

Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
---
 net/mac80211/sta_info.c | 20 +++++++++++++++++++-
 net/wireless/nl80211.c  |  3 +++
 2 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/net/mac80211/sta_info.c
+++ b/net/mac80211/sta_info.c
@@ -1572,6 +1572,21 @@ int sta_info_move_state(struct sta_info
 	return _sta_info_move_state(sta, new_state, true);
 }
 
+static void sta_set_removal_sinfo(struct sta_info *sta,
+				  struct station_info *sinfo)
+{
+	int link_id;
+
+	for (link_id = 0; link_id < IEEE80211_MLD_MAX_NUM_LINKS; link_id++)
+		if (sta->sta.valid_links & BIT(link_id))
+			sinfo->links[link_id] = kzalloc_obj(*sinfo->links[0]);
+
+	sta_set_sinfo(sta, sinfo, true);
+
+	if (sinfo->valid_links)
+		sta_set_accumulated_removed_links_sinfo(sta, sinfo);
+}
+
 static void __sta_info_destroy_part2(struct sta_info *sta, bool recalc)
 {
 	struct ieee80211_local *local = sta->local;
@@ -1627,7 +1642,7 @@ static void __sta_info_destroy_part2(str
 
 	sinfo = kzalloc_obj(*sinfo);
 	if (sinfo)
-		sta_set_sinfo(sta, sinfo, true);
+		sta_set_removal_sinfo(sta, sinfo);
 
 	if (sta->uploaded) {
 		ret = drv_sta_state(local, sdata, sta, IEEE80211_STA_NONE,
--- a/net/wireless/nl80211.c
+++ b/net/wireless/nl80211.c
@@ -21839,6 +21839,9 @@ void cfg80211_del_sta_sinfo(struct wirel
 		return;
 	}
 
+	if (sinfo->valid_links)
+		cfg80211_sta_set_mld_sinfo(sinfo);
+
 	if (nl80211_send_station(msg, NL80211_CMD_DEL_STATION, 0, 0, 0,
 				 rdev, wdev, mac_addr, sinfo) < 0) {
 		nlmsg_free(msg);
